OL,3,ASix Flags shuts down X2 rollercoaster
OL,4,Aafter hundreds allege brain injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision comes after lawsuits and
OL,7,Fnews reports alleged that hundreds of
OL,8,Friders suffered brain injuries after
OL,9,Friding X2. A law firm representing some
OL,10,Fof the plaintiffs said the decision had
OL,11,Fcome "too late" for its clients.
